                        "glosses": [
                            "entzündliche Gelenkerkrankung"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Plural selten"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "531cfb81-5262-41f3-b160-e4b87758a895",
                                "sense_id": "5431153d-cea5-32e9-a71a-673657d2b967",
                                "text": "Die reaktive Arthritis kann als Polyarthritis beginnen."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e694c86-02ee-48eb-bc2c-c29cda7ca91f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed6d838c-9266-38f9-aeb5-c88de8515b07",
                        "source_sense_id": "5431153d-cea5-32e9-a71a-673657d2b967",
                        "source_sense_description": "Medizin, Plural selten: entzündliche Gelenkerkrankung",
                        "target_lang_word": "arthritis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "arthritis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74fd3dff-5ee8-3276-b656-dfa4533948f6",
                                        "entry_id": "d960f364-4926-3523-a6df-fd6874fb2ca7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inflammation of a joint or joints causing pain and/or disability, swelling and stiffness, and due to various causes such as infection, trauma, degenerative changes or metabolic disorders: any of several disease entities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa13e242-a4fc-41fc-900c-a4c8ccf009d8",
                                                "sense_id": "74fd3dff-5ee8-3276-b656-dfa4533948f6",
                                                "text": "The suppurating osteo-myelitis and arthritis did not assume a form sufficiently putrid to cause purulent infection; the patient also escaped hecticity;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7a0b646-56f3-4664-affb-fb72f11f8c16",
                                                "sense_id": "74fd3dff-5ee8-3276-b656-dfa4533948f6",
                                                "text": "She identified the dry grasp and the finger joints (both the Simpsons were dry-handed, and in the early stages of arthritis, so Dr Simpson had diagnosed)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "812a3414-b685-4d14-bfe5-2f2c2e2e9753",
                                                "sense_id": "74fd3dff-5ee8-3276-b656-dfa4533948f6",
                                                "text": "Juvenile rheumatoid arthritis (JRA), often referred to by doctors today as juvenile idiopathic arthritis (JIA), is a type of arthritis that causes joint inflammation and stiffness for more than six weeks in a child aged 16 or younger. It affects approximately 50,000 children in the United States. Inflammation causes redness, swelling, warmth, and soreness in the joints, although many children with JRA do not complain of joint pain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "70263a46-b4da-458e-9e42-de8ad4123c15",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed6d838c-9266-38f9-aeb5-c88de8515b07",
                        "source_sense_id": "5431153d-cea5-32e9-a71a-673657d2b967",
                        "source_sense_description": "Medizin, Plural selten: entzündliche Gelenkerkrankung",
                        "target_lang_word": "arthrite",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "arthrite",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d19c8348-3b79-3390-93cd-accebcb04fe4",
                                        "entry_id": "e43245de-273b-34d1-94e0-d4b99fb69efc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nom générique qui désigne les inflammations aiguës ou chroniques des articulations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e17a1f0d-c13c-4b3a-a713-7cc6672d33c1",
                                                "sense_id": "d19c8348-3b79-3390-93cd-accebcb04fe4",
                                                "text": "Pas plus que je ne comprenais que ce vieux corps roidi par l’arthrite souffrît de se mettre au pas de ma vivacité enfantine, je n’imaginais qu’un cœur de jeune fille romanesque pût l’avoir habité jadis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a36d9fce-782e-4f7e-a73b-c3475ba74bcd",
                                                "sense_id": "d19c8348-3b79-3390-93cd-accebcb04fe4",
                                                "text": "Merde ! Et la fièvre jaune ? Et le béribéri, l’arthrite des femmes enceintes et le goudou-goudou…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5af6914-dd06-4b81-8dfe-4a6d95943033",
                                                "sense_id": "d19c8348-3b79-3390-93cd-accebcb04fe4",
                                                "text": "Tous les animaux peuvent avoir de l’arthrite c’est-à-dire une inflammation d’une articulation. L’arthrite est parfois causée par une infection."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
